<section class="ihero"><div class="ihero-text"><div class="ihero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/communities-served/">Communities</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Wasilla</span></nav><p class="kicker">Mat-Su Valley · Matanuska-Susitna Borough</p><h1>Insurance Appraiser in Wasilla, Alaska</h1><p class="lede">The Mat-Su is one of the fastest-growing parts of Alaska, and Wasilla is at its center. New subdivisions, manufactured homes and big shops all bring their own claim issues.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Borough</dt><dd>Matanuska-Susitna Borough</dd></div><div><dt>Region</dt><dd>Mat-Su Valley</dd></div><div><dt>Inspections</dt><dd>On site</dd></div></dl></div></div><figure class="ihero-photo"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wasilla.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wasilla-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wasilla.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose"><div class="snap"><div><p class="snap-k">Borough</p><p>Matanuska-Susitna Borough</p></div><div><p class="snap-k">Region</p><p>Mat-Su Valley</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Neighborhoods &amp; areas</p><p>Lake Lucille, Knik-Fairview, Meadow Lakes, Cottonwood, Settlers Bay, Big Lake, Houston</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Housing mix</p><p>Newer stick-built homes, manufactured homes, large detached garages and shops on acreage</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Notable events</p><ul><li>1996 Miller&#x27;s Reach Fire</li><li>2018 earthquake (Vine Road collapse)</li><li>January 2025 windstorm</li></ul></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Local claim risks</p><ul class="chips"><li>Wildfire &amp; smoke</li><li>Windstorms</li><li>Snow load</li><li>Frozen pipes</li><li>Earthquake (with endorsement)</li></ul></div></div>
<h2>Fast growth, newer homes</h2>
<p>Wasilla and the surrounding Matanuska-Susitna Borough have grown quickly for decades. Knik-Fairview, Meadow Lakes and the Parks Highway corridor are full of homes built since the 1990s, many by owners who have never filed a claim. Manufactured homes, modular homes and large detached garages and shops are common, often on acreage.</p>
<h2>Wildfire history</h2>
<p>The 1996 Miller's Reach Fire, which started near Big Lake and Houston, destroyed hundreds of structures and remains one of the most destructive fires in Alaska history. More recent fires near Willow, including the 2015 Sockeye Fire and the 2019 McKinley Fire, destroyed dozens of homes along the Parks Highway. Even when homes survive, smoke and ash claims can be significant.</p>
<h2>Earthquake and wind</h2>
<p>The November 2018 earthquake caused well-known damage in the Mat-Su, including the collapse of Vine Road near Wasilla, and many homes had foundation and drywall damage. The January 2025 windstorm brought down trees and damaged roofs across the borough, and the Mat-Su was among the areas covered by a state disaster declaration.</p>
<h2>Claim issues we see in Wasilla</h2>
<ul>
<li>Manufactured home claims where matching parts are no longer available</li>
<li>Shop and garage roof collapses under heavy snow</li>
<li>Smoke and ash cleaning versus replacement after nearby fires</li>
<li>Wind damage to metal roofs and siding on open lots</li>
<li>Frozen supply lines in crawlspaces and well houses</li>
</ul>
<p>We work throughout Wasilla, Knik-Fairview, Meadow Lakes, Big Lake, Houston, Willow and the Parks Highway corridor.</p>
<h2>Services available in Wasilla</h2><p>Every Alaska Insurance Appraiser service is available to property owners in Wasilla and nearby, including:</p><ul><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/appraisal-panel-representation/">Appraisal Panel Representation</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/commercial-hoa-condo-appraisal/">Commercial, HOA &amp; Condo Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/roof-damage-claim-appraisal/">Roof, Hail &amp; Ice Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/windstorm-claim-appraisal/">Windstorm Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/snow-load-ice-dam-claims/">Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Claims</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/frozen-pipe-water-damage-appraisal/">Frozen Pipe &amp; Water Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/fire-smoke-ash-claim-appraisal/">Fire, Smoke &amp; Wildfire Appraisal</a></li></ul>
<h2>Questions from Wasilla property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is smoke damage covered if the fire did not reach my home?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Smoke damage is often covered under the fire peril, but the extent of the damage is frequently disputed. Document it early.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is my shop covered under my homeowner policy?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Detached structures are usually covered under Other Structures, often at a percentage of the dwelling limit. Large shops may need higher limits.</p></div></details></div><h2>Nearby communities</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/palmer-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Palmer</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/eagle-river-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Eagle River &amp; Chugiak</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/anchorage-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Anchorage</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-stick"><div class="side-box call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through</h2><p>Free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class